{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/AddDecl.html#Lean.addAndCompile\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">addAndCompile</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">decl</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Declaration.html#Lean.Declaration\">Declaration</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">logCompileErrors</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">markMeta</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.false\">false</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/AddDecl.html#Lean.addAndCompile","kind":"def","line":245,"name":"Lean.addAndCompile","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/AddDecl.lean#L245-L251"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/AddDecl.html#Lean.addDecl\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">addDecl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">decl</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Declaration.html#Lean.Declaration\">Declaration</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">forceExpose</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.false\">false</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Adds the given declaration to the environment's private scope, deriving a suitable presentation in\nthe public scope if under the module system and if the declaration is not private. If `forceExpose`\nis true, exposes the declaration body, i.e. preserves the full representation in the public scope,\nindependently of `Environment.isExporting` and even for theorems.","docLink":"./Lean/AddDecl.html#Lean.addDecl","kind":"def","line":235,"name":"Lean.addDecl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/AddDecl.lean#L235-L243"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/AddDecl.html#Lean.recordOriginalConstKind\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">recordOriginalConstKind</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">env</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Environment</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">kind</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.ConstantKind\">ConstantKind</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Environment</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Records that `declName` is about to be added as a declaration of kind `kind` that is exported as a\ndifferent kind; see `getOriginalConstKind?`. `addDecl` does this by itself, so this function is\nneeded only where `addDecl` is run on a different environment branch, in order to make the\ninformation available on the current branch early.","docLink":"./Lean/AddDecl.html#Lean.recordOriginalConstKind","kind":"def","line":101,"name":"Lean.recordOriginalConstKind","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/AddDecl.lean#L101-L109"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/AddDecl.html#Lean.warnIfUsesSorry\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">warnIfUsesSorry</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">decl</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Declaration.html#Lean.Declaration\">Declaration</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If the `warn.sorry` option is set to true and there are no errors in the log already,\nlogs a warning if the declaration uses `sorry`.","docLink":"./Lean/AddDecl.html#Lean.warnIfUsesSorry","kind":"def","line":76,"name":"Lean.warnIfUsesSorry","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/AddDecl.lean#L76-L96"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/AddDecl.html#Lean.warn.sorry\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">warn</span>.<span class=\"name\">sorry</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Options.html#Lean.Option\">Lean.Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `warn.sorry` is set to true, then, so long as the message log does not already have any errors,\ndeclarations with `sorryAx` generate the \"declaration uses `sorry`\" warning.","docLink":"./Lean/AddDecl.html#Lean.warn.sorry","kind":"opaque","